  "description": "Ira is an independent designer specializing in branding and visual design strategy. After years in the consumer and fintech branding realms, she joined Web3 in early 2018 and has since served as a Creative Director at companies big and small, helping founders win hearts and minds of early adopters and funders. \r\nThese days, she runs her own design practice and conducts DIY (design-it-yourself) workshops for pre- and seed-stage companies."
